ab7faae5d7b250ea8606486575f8f79c: what behavior was a &quot;problem&quot;? being compatible with Adobe or being XML-wise correct?
ab7faae5d7b250ea8606486575f8f79c: is doctype whatever really whatever or a magic SVG doctype?
28a6d36d2fd2e2e987a704be0c3f7b0e: Being compatible with content with &lt;svg&gt; (no doctype and no xmlns)
28a6d36d2fd2e2e987a704be0c3f7b0e: It's not really &quot;whatever&quot;, that's just a placeholder for some string whose constraints I am unaware of
